  ('steve@sonuslucis.com', 'Sonus Lucis', 'Loving music and learning piano', 'Hastings, East Sussex, England, United Kingdom', 'I was very lucky as a child. There was always music playing in the house. Recorded though, neither of my parents played any instruments. My father introduced me to a varied selection of music which is probably where my eclectic taste comes from.

